  "thag1.104:1.1": "Lahuko vata me kāyo ",
  "thag1.104:1.2": "phuṭṭho ca pītisukhena vipulena, ",
  "thag1.104:1.3": "tūlam iva eritaṃ mālutena ",
  "thag1.104:1.4": "pilavati va me kāyo 'ti. ",
  "thag1.104:1.5": "Ukkaṇṭhito pi "
}
